{"articleNo":"148094","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=148094&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016 신입생 및 편입생 금융학생증 수령 관련 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.03.09","hit":"3182","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&lt;2016 신입생 및 편입생 금융학생증 수령 관련&gt; 안내</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">오리엔테이션&nbsp;기간 또는 금융학생증 추가신청기간 중 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">각 학부(과)로 제출했거나 금융기관(농협, IBK기업은행)으로 신청한 금융학생증은 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">신청일자에&nbsp;따라 일괄발급되어 순차적으로 배부될 예정입니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">농협 금융학생증</span></span></span></span></span></font></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">을 신청하신 학생은&nbsp;발급되는대로 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">농협에서 </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\" color=\"#ff00dd\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">수령관련 안내 문자메세지를 개별안내 </strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">할 예정이며, </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">교내 농협(글로벌관 1층)으로&nbsp;직접 내방</span></span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">하셔서 본인확인 후,&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">바로 수령하시면 됩니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">IBK기업은행 금융학생증</span></span></span></span></span></strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">을 신청하신 학생은 발급되는대로 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">IBK기업은행에서 </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\" color=\"#ff00dd\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">수령관련 안내 문자메세지를 개별안내</strong></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"> 할 예정이며, </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학생회관 1층(101호) 학생복지팀</span></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">에서 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">본인확인후 수령하시면 됩니다.</span>&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1학년 학생 전체가 대상인 관계로 2~3주 정도의 기간이 소요될 예정입니다. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금융기관의 안내 문자메세지에 따라 각 해당 장소에서 배부받으시면 됩니다.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기간 동안 </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">도서관 이용(열람좌석예약, 도서자료 대출 등)은 </strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">우리대학 도서관&nbsp;애플리케이션 &lt;클리커(Clicker)&gt;를 통해 이용</strong>하실 수 있습니다. </span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">☞<font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong></strong></font><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/homepage/default/page/subLocation.do?menu_no=1001060101&amp;conf_no=38&amp;board_no=146448&amp;flag=mini\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong> 도서관 &lt;클리커&gt; 이용 안내 </strong></font></a></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"></p><table class=\"txc-table\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"684\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000 1px solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000 1px solid; WIDTH: 100%; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000 1px solid\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ** 요즘 대포통장 개설&nbsp;등의 금융사기&nbsp;문제발생 방지를 위해 금융기관에서는</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금융학생증 발급을 위한 <strong>계좌개설 안내문자가 학생증 발급 되기 전에 공지</strong>되고 있습니다. &nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 계좌개설 문자확인 2~3주 후에 발송되는</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><u><strong>금융학생증발급 안내 문자 확인 후, </strong></u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u> 농협 및 학생복지팀 방문</u></strong> 부탁드립니다. </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">* 학생증 관련 문의 : ☎ 054)478-7068 (학생복지팀)</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">* 클리커 관련 문의 : ☎ 054)478-7168 (열람팀)</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
